WEBVTT

00:00:39.362 --> 00:00:42.362
A woman in a black T-shirt with a gold necklace speaks to camera, gesturing with both hands, then lowers them, seated before a wall-mounted screen and shelf.

00:01:04.324 --> 00:01:07.324
She reaches one arm off to the side, then brings both hands up, palms open and spread wide, leaning slightly closer to the camera as she talks.

00:01:26.758 --> 00:01:29.758
A teal slide reading "What is the algorithm?" cuts to a white slide headed "TikTok has stated:", with a phone clip of TikTok CEO Shou Chew beside highlighted paragraph text.

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:52.934
Back at the white desk, she lowers her hands out of frame, then raises one open palm beside her face, gesturing as she speaks toward the camera.

00:02:16.354 --> 00:02:19.354
A slide titled "THE 'FYP'" shows the highlighted TikTok mission text, then cuts back to her at the white desk, both hands rising as she talks.

00:02:38.443 --> 00:02:41.443
A static slide headed "THE 'FYP' EXPLAINED" holds two captioned icon panels — a person with data charts, an arrow, and three stacked video players.

00:02:58.803 --> 00:03:01.803
The interests-selection screenshot swaps for a settings menu with "Language" outlined in green, as a second numbered line appears: "The users device & account settings."

00:03:24.298 --> 00:03:27.298
Back at the white desk, the presenter in a black tee gestures with open palms, then presses her hands together, a collage-filled screen glowing behind her.

00:03:48.878 --> 00:03:51.878
A hand-drawn black oval is scribbled around the third listed point, "The users interactions (and non-actions) with the app," on the white slide.

00:04:09.727 --> 00:04:12.727
The teal slide titled "'Insterest Signals'" holds an empty white box; a first bullet appears inside it reading "Watching or skipping a video."

00:04:31.454 --> 00:04:34.454
The completed three-column bullet list stays on screen, then the shot cuts to the presenter in a black top at a white desk, monitor behind her.

00:05:02.027 --> 00:05:05.027
A teal slide with a video-player icon asks how TikTok ranks FYP videos, then cuts to a phone mockup playing a yoga clip beside bracketed text.

00:05:22.285 --> 00:05:25.285
The bulleted slide beside the phone mockup gives way to the presenter at her desk, hands lifting and gesturing toward herself as she speaks to camera.

00:05:45.087 --> 00:05:48.087
She continues speaking at the white desk, hands lowering out of frame then rising again, the collage-filled monitor, tripod camera and small lamps behind her.

00:06:10.251 --> 00:06:13.251
Her raised hands drop out of frame, and she sits still at the desk, facing the camera as she talks, the collage monitor glowing behind her.

00:06:37.134 --> 00:06:40.134
She sits talking, then leans closer toward the camera, both hands lifting into frame and gesturing near her chest, the collage monitor behind her.

00:07:29.481 --> 00:07:32.481
A full-screen slide headed "TIKTOK SEARCH" holds steady, showing phone mockups of feed, video and comment screens, labelled 'Search' and 'Recommended Search' with circled terms.

00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:56.458
A phone mockup of TikTok search results sits beside the heading; a subheading "Relevance and Content Information" then appears with a bullet about captions, text and hashtags.

00:08:22.505 --> 00:08:25.505
Subheadings "Engagement" and "User interactions" stack below on the slide, then the shot cuts to the presenter in a black tee gesturing at her desk.

00:08:45.384 --> 00:08:48.384
The presenter speaks to camera before the slide returns, now listing "User information" with a bullet reading "Device settings, language preferences, & location" beneath the previous factors.

00:09:06.156 --> 00:09:09.156
A new slide highlights "Relevance and Content Information," with a boxed sentence partly marked in blue; beside it, a phone screenshot displays food search results and thumbnails.

00:09:57.607 --> 00:10:00.607
She gestures with one hand toward the wall-mounted screen of collaged images behind her, then lowers both arms, clasping her hands in front of her chest.

00:10:23.177 --> 00:10:26.177
A text slide reads "When you think like the algorithm… You can better predict which videos will engage well with your audience," then cuts back to her, hands raised mid-gesture.

00:10:44.546 --> 00:10:47.546
A slide headed "How to work with the algorithm to show up in 'Search':" lists one point beside a graphic of a search bar with question marks.

00:11:05.933 --> 00:11:08.933
A phone mockup shows a plant-shop TikTok captioned "Low light plants"; the slide's numbered list grows to four points, adding use of the phrase throughout the video.

00:11:30.227 --> 00:11:33.227
A new slide titled "How to work with the algorithm to show up on the FYP:" holds one point beside a figure icon with arrows to question marks.

00:12:15.285 --> 00:12:18.285
The slide now lists four numbered points beside a phone mockup playing a TikTok of a woman in a pink sweater adjusting her hair.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.900
The woman in a black tee sits before a wall-mounted screen of collaged images, gesturing with one hand, then closing her eyes briefly before raising both hands.

00:13:11.252 --> 00:13:14.252
She raises an open palm beside her face, lowers her arm to her lap, then sweeps her hand upward again in a blur of motion.

00:13:35.388 --> 00:13:38.388
Both hands rise near her chest, then drop out of frame as she pauses, before her left palm opens outward beside her again.

00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:37.333
Her hands rest low, then one sweeps across her chest in a blur before her other palm lifts open beside her shoulder, fingers spread.

00:15:03.257 --> 00:15:06.257
Her hands settle out of frame as she stops speaking, sitting still facing the camera with a closed-mouth smile before the photo-collage screen and desk lamps.

